# Copy to .env (gitignored). `make setup` does it for you, and
# `.worktreeinclude` copies .env into agent worktrees automatically.
# wowlab needs no credentials: it reads a local install and never uploads.

# Optional. Absolute path of the World of Warcraft install root (the directory
# that holds `.build.info`). Leave unset to use the platform defaults in
# docs/LAB_PLAN.md §6.1; set it for a non-default location or a Linux
# (Wine, Lutris, Proton) install. An explicit `--root` argument wins over it.
# The tools read it from the process environment; export it in your shell.
# WOWLAB_WOW_ROOT=/Applications/World of Warcraft
